   "label": "",
   "heavy": null,
   "start": 1114,
   "end": 1199,
   "chars": 11,
   "highlight": null,
   "plain": "那圈薄光，就是全部的空气。"
  },
  {
   "no": 13,
   "text": "把地球缩成一个篮球——",
   "scene": "G2",
